# Secrets must never enter the image. `both.Dockerfile` does `COPY ./backend .`, which was
# shipping backend/.env into /app/.env — inert while config.js skipped dotenv in production,
# NOT inert since story 24.1 made the load unconditional. Found by code review, 2026-08-11.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
backups
logs
**/*.log
_bmad-output
.claude
